Crystal Random is a jewelry house in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/index|Hallia]], down the street from [[Org/Guren and Guren/index|Guren and Guren]]. The two are rivals.

A day or two before the investigators came asking, Crystal Random took in something expensive, meant for a wealthy client. The receptionist would say no more than that, and no one higher up would see the investigators, though they left a number.
